st-psicodelia (EE UU)","book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","start":1990,"end":2001,"desc":"La psicodelia, el mayor invento de los sesenta, sigue siendo el género dominante en los noventa, con los mismos estilos básicos (el pop psicodélico de los Doors, el freak-out de Red Crayola, el trance de la Velvet, la jam de los Grateful Dead) más el dream-pop y el shoegazing. Mercury Rev logran una síntesis de proporciones históricas (Yerself Is Steam, Deserter's Songs); Luna, Motion Picture, Arson Garden, Tadpoles, Uncle Wiggly, Brother J.T., Space Needle. En la Costa Oeste, Medicine, Sky Cries Mary, Brian Jonestown Massacre (enciclopedias psicodélicas), Quasi, Dandy Warhols.","color":"#c084fc","family":"Psicodelia, garage y shoegaze","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#post-psych"}],"book_tracks":[{"id":28724437890869,"artist":"Brian Jonestown Massacre","artist_id":261096161771231,"title":"Methodrone","year":1995,"ess":0,"yt":"qbCn_BvYrhE","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Post-psicodelia (EE UU)","scene_id":208681794204011,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#post-psych","chapters":["Sección 6.3"],"pages":[[1,235,null]]},{"id":112181867271521,"artist":"Brian Jonestown Massacre","artist_id":261096161771231,"title":"Their Satanic Majesties' Second Request","year":1996,"ess":0,"yt":"UQyq--_ArAk","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Post-psicodelia (EE UU)","scene_id":208681794204011,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#post-psych","chapters":["Sección 6.3"],"pages":[[1,235,null]]},{"id":154765409945572,"artist":"Brian Jonestown Massacre","artist_id":261096161771231,"title":"Take It From The Man","year":1996,"ess":0,"yt":"awa-1wN-a10","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A Histo